  "title": "Cheesecake Fruit Salad",
  "description": "This cheesecake fruit salad recipe features berries, bananas, and grapes folded into a creamy, mixture of pudding mix, whipped topping, and cream cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "Rebekah Rose Hills"
